*.pyc

# ---- raw / large reference material (regenerable with tools/*.py, not needed to rebuild)
# satellite strips + per-tile metadata (tools/google_tiles.py / esri_tiles.py)
ref/sat/
# raw chart vectors and page rasters dumped from the CAAC AIP PDF (tools/export_drawings.py);
# ref/derived/chart_enu.json (the calibrated ENU version) IS committed
ref/apron/*.json
ref/apron/*.png
ref/derived/model_on_google.png
ref/derived/overlay_t2_crop.png
ref/airports.csv
ref/runways.csv

# ---- build / render noise
build/*.blend1
build/*.log
out/*.log
out/renders/*.log
out/renders/shot_*.png
out/renders/_warmup.png
out/renders/render_views.jsonl
out/results/

